        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>第七单元 学习任务群设计</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", sans-serif;\n    background: #f2eef6;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n    background: #fdfbfe;\n    border: 3px solid #ffffff;\n    padding: 10px 14px 20px 14px;\n    min-height: 762px;\n  }\n  .dashed-frame {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 8px; left: 10px; right: 10px; bottom: 10px;\n    border: 2px dashed #b7a9d6;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n    border: 1px dashed #c9c0dd;\n    color: #8d84a3;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .bunting {\n    width: 512px;\n    height: 78px;\n    margin: 0 auto 4px auto;\n  }\n  .header {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 76px;\n  }\n  .unit-tag {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 6px;\n    top: 18px;\n    width: 108px;\n    height: 30px;\n    background: #d9232e;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 30px;\n    transform: rotate(-2deg);\n    box-shadow: 2px 2px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n  }\n  .title-banner {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 128px;\n    top: 6px;\n    width: 250px;\n    height: 40px;\n    background: #22a3a9;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 40px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n  }\n  .subtitle {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 128px;\n    top: 50px;\n    width: 250px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #333;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 16px;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n  .col { width: 50%; }\n  .divider {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 50%;\n    top: 130px;\n    bottom: 24px;\n    width: 0;\n    border-left: 2px dashed #8fb9c9;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n  .arrow-label {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    padding: 5px 12px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    min-width: 130px;\n    margin-bottom: -2px;\n  }\n  .arrow-left {\n    clip-path: polygon(0% 50%, 10px 0%, 100% 0%, 100% 100%, 10px 100%);\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .arrow-right {\n    clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 100% 0%, calc(100% - 10px) 50%, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);\n    padding-right: 20px;\n    text-align: right;\n    float: right;\n  }\n  .box {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    color: #222;\n    clear: both;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .box p { margin: 0 0 6px 0; text-indent: 2em; }\n  .box p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  /* color themes */\n  .blue-lbl { background: #4aa3d8; }\n  .blue-box { background: #dceefb; }\n  .green-lbl { background: #7cc06a; }\n  .green-box { background: #e5f5df; }\n  .yellow-lbl { background: #f0c33c; }\n  .yellow-box { background: #fdf5da; }\n  .greenr-lbl { background: #66b96f; }\n  .greenr-box { background: #e6f6e6; }\n  .purple-lbl { background: #7f74c4; }\n  .purple-box { background: #ece9f8; }\n  .pink-lbl { background: #ef5f7a; }\n  .pink-box { background: #fde8ec; }\n  .cyan-lbl { background: #35b7c6; }\n  .cyan-box { background: #e0f5f7; }\n\n  .block { margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .num { display: inline-block; margin-right: 6px; }\n  .center-sub { text-align: center; font-size: 12.5px; margin: 4px 0 6px 0; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"dashed-frame\"></div>\n\n  <figure class=\"placeholder bunting\" style=\"margin:0 auto 4px auto;\">[Decoration: colorful triangular bunting flags strung across top of page]</figure>\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"unit-tag\">第七单元</div>\n    <div class=\"title-banner\">学习任务群设计</div>\n    <div class=\"subtitle\">学习动态描写和静态描写</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <div class=\"block\">\n        <div class=\"arrow-label arrow-left blue-lbl\"><span class=\"num\">21</span>古诗词三首</div>\n        <div class=\"box blue-box\">\n          <p>抓住古诗中静态描写和动态描写想象画面，如《山居秋暝》一诗中，静态描写：“明月松间照”。 动态描写：“清泉石上流”“竹喧归浣女”“莲动下渔舟”。这首诗动中衬静，写出了山间傍晚的幽静。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"block\">\n        <div class=\"arrow-label arrow-left greenr-lbl\"><span class=\"num\">23</span>鸟的天堂</div>\n        <div class=\"box greenr-box\">\n          <p>第一次去“鸟的天堂”，作者抓住大榕树的根、干、枝、叶等部位展开写，写出了大榕树的茂盛和充满活力，是静态描写。</p>\n          <p>第二次去“鸟的天堂”，描写了鸟的活动场面，是动态描写，动静结合，让我们觉得大榕树真的是“鸟的天堂”。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"block\">\n        <div class=\"arrow-label arrow-left yellow-lbl\">交流平台</div>\n        <div class=\"box yellow-box\">\n          <p>关注静态描写和动态描写的句子，品味并积累，强化单元语文要素。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <div class=\"block\">\n        <div class=\"arrow-label arrow-right green-lbl\"><span class=\"num\">22</span>四季之美</div>\n        <div class=\"box green-box\">\n          <p>第1自然段描写春天黎明时分的天空，用“鱼肚色、红晕、红紫红柴”写出了天空颜色的变化，用“泛、染、飘”等动词和“一点儿一点儿、微微的”等叠词写出了天空颜色变化的过程。第2自然段描写夏夜萤火虫飞舞的迷人情景。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"block\">\n        <div class=\"arrow-label arrow-right purple-lbl\"><span class=\"num\">24</span>月迹</div>\n        <div class=\"box purple-box\">\n          <p>抓住作者对月亮爬竹帘格儿的动态描写，以及对满院子玉玉的、银银的月光的静态描写，体会月亮动态时的顽皮可爱、静态时的恬静柔美。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"block\">\n        <div class=\"arrow-label arrow-right pink-lbl\">词句段运用</div>\n        <div class=\"box pink-box\">\n          <p>第二题：读下面的例句，体会作者是如何把一个画面写具体的，仿照着写一写。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"block\">\n        <div class=\"arrow-label arrow-right cyan-lbl\">单元习作</div>\n        <div class=\"box cyan-box\">\n          <div class=\"center-sub\">——&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;即景</div>\n          <p>习作内容：观察一种自然现象或一处自然景观，重点观察景物的变化，写下观察所得。根据自己的观察对象，把题目补充完整，如“雨中即景”“日落即景”“田野即景”“窗外即景”。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
